syaml

Safe YAML for Rust.

syaml is a maintained fork of serde_yaml and unsafe-libyaml, both
archived in March 2024. It keeps the serde_yaml API and replaces the
c2rust translation of libyaml with safe Rust, one part at a time.

Status: early. Not usable yet.

Plan: see PLAN.
License: Apache 2.0. See LICENSE and NOTICE.
